Setup			B_a_3D_gas

### Disk parameters

AspectRatio     	0.05            Thickness over Radius in the disc
Sigma0			1.0 		Surface Density at r=1
SigmaSlope		1.0		Slope of the surface density
FlaringIndex		0.25		Flare of the disk
ALPHA               1.0e-2
Beta                1.0
Gamma               1.4

### Dust parameters

Invstokes1		10.0   Inverse of the Stokes number for dust1
Epsilon                 1.0e-20    Dust-to-gas mass ratio
DUSTFLOOR       1.0e-6

### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig        planets/modelB_J3e-4.cfg
ThicknessSmoothing 	0.557
Eccentricity		0.0
IndirectTerm		yes

### Mesh parameters

Nx			768		Number of azimuthal zones
Ny               	256		Number of Radial zones
Nz          128

Xmin		       -3.14159265358979323844
Xmax			3.14159265358979323844

Ymin			0.3		Inner radius
Ymax			2.3		Outer radius

Zmin            1.320796326794897
Zmax            1.820796326794897

Disk            YES
OmegaFrame     		1.0
Frame			G

### Damping
DampingZone     1.2
TauDamp         0.1

### Output control parameters
CFL         0.3
DT			0.314159265359	Time step length
Ninterm	 		100		Time steps between outputs
Ntot			2000		Total number of time steps

FuncArchFile    setups/B_a_3D_gas/func_arch.cfg
OutputDir		@outputs/B_a_3D